{
  "name": "alpha_crowd_lowtier",
  "description": "Legacy-alpha stage 0, low tier: the same measurement as alpha_crowd.json with the settings of a weak GPU (lowest quality level, no shadows, no reflections, no SSAO or glow, small textures), to be run in a 1920x1080 window. Sorted alpha is the only transparency path of a GPU without OpenGL 4, so method 0 is the number that matters here; method 1 shows what stochastic would cost the same machine (on a GL 3.3 device it falls back to sorted).",
